## Component Requirements (ALL MANDATORY)

Every component that fetches data MUST have:
- ✅ **Loading state** — `<Skeleton />` component (never just a spinner)
- ✅ **Empty state** — `<EmptyState message="No complaints found" action={<Button>File complaint</Button>} />`
- ✅ **Error state** — `<ErrorState message={error.message} onRetry={refetch} />`
- ✅ **Role guard** — `<RoleGuard roles={['OFFICER', 'ADMIN']}>` wraps any role-conditional UI

---

## Security Rules

1. **JWT in memory only.** Access token stored in Zustand (`useAuthStore`). Refresh token in httpOnly cookie (set by backend). NEVER `localStorage` or `sessionStorage`.
2. **Auto-refresh.** Axios response interceptor handles 401 → refresh token → retry original request.
3. **Tenant header on every request.** Axios request interceptor adds `X-Tenant-ID: {tenant.id}`.
4. **Never expose internal IDs.** API receives UUIDs from Zustand store, never from URL params.
5. **RoleGuard everywhere.** Any button/action with role restriction uses `<RoleGuard>` — no manual `user.role === 'ADMIN'` checks in JSX.

