## Design System

### Color Tokens (Tailwind)
```js
// tailwind.config.ts:
govos: {
  blue:   { DEFAULT: '#1B4FD8', light: '#3B6FEF', dark: '#1038A8' },
  green:  { DEFAULT: '#16A34A', light: '#22C55E', dark: '#14532D' },
  amber:  { DEFAULT: '#D97706', light: '#F59E0B', dark: '#92400E' },
  red:    { DEFAULT: '#DC2626', light: '#EF4444', dark: '#991B1B' },
  slate:  { 900: '#0F172A', 800: '#1E293B', 700: '#334155' },
}
```

### Typography
- Primary: `Inter` (loaded from Google Fonts)
- Monospace (IDs, codes): `JetBrains Mono`
- Base: 14px. Min: 12px. Heading scale: 16/18/20/24/28/32px.

### Animation (Framer Motion)
```tsx
// Module enter animation:
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 8 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  exit={{ opacity: 0, y: -8 }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.15, ease: "easeOut" }}
>

// Sidebar item hover:
whileHover={{ x: 4 }}
transition={{ duration: 0.1 }}
```

