## Responsive Design Rules

| Breakpoint | Behavior |
|------------|----------|
| `<640px` (mobile) | Data tables → card lists, modals → bottom sheets, sidebar → hamburger menu |
| `640–1024px` (tablet) | Condensed sidebar, stacked layouts |
| `>1024px` (desktop) | Full sidebar, multi-column layouts, side panels |

Mobile-specific components:
- `<BottomSheet>` replaces `<Modal>` on mobile
- `<CardList>` replaces `<DataTable>` on mobile
- Minimum touch target: 44×44px

---

## Forbidden Patterns

- ❌ `window.location.href` or `<a href>` for module navigation — use Zustand `setActiveModule`
- ❌ `localStorage.setItem('token', ...)` — JWT in memory only
- ❌ `useState` for API data — use TanStack Query
- ❌ `useEffect` for data fetching — use `useQuery`
- ❌ Inline `user.role === 'ADMIN'` checks — use `<RoleGuard>`
- ❌ Default exports from feature components (except lazy-loaded index)
- ❌ `any` in TypeScript
- ❌ Missing loading/empty/error states
- ❌ `outline: none` without visible focus replacement (accessibility)
- ❌ Hardcoded colors — always use design tokens from `tailwind.config.ts`
- ❌ `console.log` in production code

